{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24332","headline":"以诗代书寄户部杨侍郎劝买东邻王家宅 · 白居易","name":"以诗代书寄户部杨侍郎劝买东邻王家宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劝君买取东邻宅，与我衡门相并开。\n云映嵩峰当户牖，月和伊水入池台。\n林园亦要闻闲置，筋力应须及健回。\n莫学因循白宾客，欲年六十始归来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24332.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24332","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}